5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable system for the year. To do that, we should first understand the actual time and costs involved. What do you all think we should prioritize?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree, Minako. A sustainable system requires a foundation of objective data. I believe we should prioritize understanding the actual usage patterns and the time commitment required to maintain our standards. Logic suggests fairness follows usage.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want it to be clean every single time I walk in! It's like a surprise game right now, but not a fun one. Let's find out why it's so messy sometimes!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so important that we all feel comfortable in our home. I agree with you all. Perhaps we should also look into how we handle the costs of our cleaning supplies to keep things fair.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see us all coming together. Let us remember that a home is built on harmony, not just hygiene. I believe we should seek a balance that preserves our friendship for the year.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with the need for harmony, but clarity prevents conflict. To get a real picture, I suggest we look into the actual time it takes to clean and how we define ""done.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. If we cannot agree on what ""done"" means, we are merely guessing. I also suggest we examine the actual frequency of use for the shared spaces to ensure the labor is distributed logically.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, I want to know what everyone thinks is ""done""! Maybe some people think a little dust is okay, but I don't! Let's also check the wall calendar to see who's been away!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful idea, Sakura. I think it would also be very helpful to look at the receipts for the bathroom spray and the management office's billing to see our monthly costs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom teaches us that resentment grows in the gaps of unspoken expectations. To keep our spirits high, I suggest we examine the notes from previous tenants and the records in our house chat.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have a good list of priorities. To keep this efficient, let's each pick two items to investigate. I'll take the stopwatch timing of a full pass and what each housemate counts as done.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall take a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and the absences on the wall calendar. It would be most illogical to assign duties without knowing who is actually present to create the mess.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll pick what each housemate counts as done and the bathroom grout after the July scrub! I want to see if the grout is still sparkly or if it's hiding some secrets!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will look into the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, as well as the management office rate sheet and billing. I hope this helps us find a fair way to handle our expenses.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the note left by the previous tenants and the rows recorded in the house chat. Understanding the ghosts of conflicts past will help us build a more peaceful future together.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,That covers everything. We have a clear division of labor for the research. Let's each gather our findings and reconvene to discuss the best system for the year. I look forward to seeing the data.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I shall conduct my observations with the utmost precision. I look forward to seeing if the data aligns with our perceptions, or if we have been operating under a series of convenient illusions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm on it! I'll be a super-detective and find all the clues! I can't wait to see if the bathroom is actually clean or just pretending to be! See you all soon!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will do my best to gather the information carefully. I hope that by clearing up these little details, we can all continue to live together with happy and peaceful hearts. See you all soon.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May your investigations be fruitful and your hearts remain light. I shall reflect on the lessons of the past while you gather the facts of the present. Until we meet again, my dear friends.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
