60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Given the time cost of nearly two hours per pass, Option B is the most efficient. It removes the labor burden entirely and ensures a professional standard, eliminating the disputes over what ""done"" means.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"While Option B is efficient, it ignores the usage disparity. However, it is the only choice that removes the friction of labor distribution entirely. A financial cost is far more logical and easier to split than an unfair time burden.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I like Option B too! A professional will make it sparkly every time, and we won't have to argue about the checklist. No more scary surprises in the bathroom for me!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B sounds very reliable for the cleaning, but I am concerned about the payments. If we choose this, can we please ensure the monthly invoice is shared clearly so no one is left out of pocket?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"I agree that Option B offers a sanctuary from conflict. By removing the burden of labor, we remove the spark that ignites resentment. Let us choose the path that keeps our friendship intact.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, we can easily manage the invoice with a shared spreadsheet or a simple group message. Compared to the risk of burnout and arguments over standards, the financial cost is a small price for our peace of mind.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I agree. While I initially sought a usage-based labor split, the data suggests that any manual system—be it A or C—will inevitably lead to disputes over fairness and quality. Paying for a professional is the most rational solution.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what about Option C? If we just pick a room, we might forget! And Option A is just a different kind of surprise. Option B is the only one that guarantees it's actually clean!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, thank you for the suggestion. A shared spreadsheet would be very helpful. If we can be transparent about the costs and the payments, I feel much more comfortable with Option B. It seems the most peaceful choice for us all.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, transparency is the bridge to trust. By choosing Option B, we avoid the pitfalls of policing one another. Let us invest in our harmony and ensure our home remains a place of warmth and laughter.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have reached a consensus. Option B solves the time burden, the quality inconsistency, and the potential for interpersonal conflict. I will vote for Option B to ensure our time is spent on things other than scrubbing.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also vote for Option B. It is the only choice that replaces subjective arguments over labor and usage with a predictable financial transaction. Logic dictates that peace is worth the price.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for Option B too! I want the bathroom to be sparkly and the kitchen to be clean every single day without any guessing. Yay for professional cleaners!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will also vote for Option B. As long as we are careful and honest with our shared expenses, it seems like the most gentle way for us to live together in harmony.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I shall join you all in voting for Option B. It is far better to share a small cost than to risk the heavy price of a fractured friendship. Let us choose peace and kindness.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we are all in agreement, the decision is clear. I vote for Option B. Let's set up the payment system immediately so we can start enjoying a clean home without the stress.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I vote for Option B. It is the most rational conclusion to our data gathering. By outsourcing the labor, we eliminate the variables of usage and standard, ensuring a stable environment for the year.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I vote for Option B! I'm so happy we're doing this! Now I can walk into the bathroom with a big smile instead of holding my breath! Yay!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I vote for Option B. I am glad we have found a solution that makes everyone happy. Let us be very mindful of our shared costs so that everything remains fair and peaceful.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"I vote for Option B. May this decision be the seed from which a year of laughter and mutual respect grows. Let us cherish our home and, more importantly, each other.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
